{"v":4,"catch":"殲滅機械人大軍!","desc":"\"THUNDER CROSS \"是KONAMI於1988年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n控制BLUE THUNDER M-45，與機械人大軍作戰。\n遊戲中包含了多個版本，比如有不同難度的 \"舊日本版 \"和 \"新日本版\"，以及 \"歐洲版 \"和重新編排的 \"北美版\"。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-02-11","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0fc9e84c24441a1247249efd9b05fe86bb872a8b57758d471990f97f90aeabb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/830d4daa91d77e4572ed7c33607c3bb7d8b1a70a3ace8847d677ec991e968fa9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/71c61695bbcd657bbdcdd21d79f1600e4cfc86d3f587bb07335a6ba5a2aaf117.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d45476aba35f55eb8579036b18b4bb80f70e8f50de11b78d5c52a91be7ef3bf7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e398d816cd248188dff6882667624987e0550c6d324680752178ae9136f4dd6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f5f6ce5176bfab04a23e3771ea32342b5a597568194dbc4953fa3a67eb87cc8e.jpg"],"titleId":"01004e4013e62000","dlc":[]}